        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eaton%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Chenango River, a south‑flowing tributary of the Susquehanna, originates within Eaton’s borders.",
